      "permalink": "plet-bsubisub--1-for-i--1-2--101-suppose-jee-advanced-mathematics-complex-numbers-7dj71a8uatwris4w",
      "content": "<p>Let b<sub>i</sub> > 1 for I = 1, 2, ......, 101. Suppose log<sub>e</sub>b<sub>1</sub>, log<sub>e</sub>b<sub>2</sub>, ......., log<sub>e</sub>b<sub>101</sub> are in Arithmetic Progression (A.P.) with the common difference log<sub>e</sub>2. Suppose a<sub>1</sub>, a<sub>2</sub>, ......, a<sub>101</sub> are in A.P. such that a<sub>1</sub> = b<sub>1</sub> and a<sub>51</sub> = b<sub>51</sub>. If t = b<sub>1</sub> + b<sub>2</sub> + .... + b<sub>51</sub> and s = a<sub>1</sub> + a<sub>2</sub> + ..... + a<sub>51</sub>, then</p>",
      "options": [
        {
          "identifier": "A",
          "content": "s > t and a<sub>101</sub> > b<sub>101</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "B",
          "content": "s > t and a<sub>101</sub> < b<sub>101</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "C",
          "content": "s < t and a<sub>101</sub> > b<sub>101</sub>"
        },
        {
          "identifier": "D",
          "content": "s < t and a<sub>101</sub> < b<sub>101</sub>"
        }
      ],
      "correct_options": [
        "B"
      ],
      "explanation": "<p>If logb<sub>1</sub>, logb<sub>2</sub>, ......, logb<sub>101</sub> are in A.P. with common difference log<sub>e</sub>2, then b<sub>1</sub>, b<sub>2</sub>, ......, b<sub>101</sub> are in G.P., with common ratio 2.</p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -0.186ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"1.509ex\" height=\"1.251ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -471 667 553\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"2234\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-2234\"></use></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container> b<sub>1</sub> = 2<sup>0</sup>b<sub>1</sub></p>\n<p>b<sub>2</sub> = 2<sup>1</sup>b<sub>1</sub></p>\n<p>b<sub>3</sub> = 2<sup>2</sup>b<sub>1</sub></p>\n<p><mjx-container class=\"MathJax\" jax=\"SVG\" overflow=\"overflow\"><svg style=\"vertical-align: -1.471ex;\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"7.317ex\" height=\"4.072ex\" role=\"img\" focusable=\"false\" viewBox=\"0 -1150 3234 1800\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><g stroke=\"currentColor\" fill=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"0\" transform=\"scale(1,-1)\"><g data-mml-node=\"math\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtable\" data-frame-styles=\"\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtr\" transform=\"translate(0,-275)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(200,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"22EE\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22EE\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(1478,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"22EE\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22EE\"></use></g></g><g data-mml-node=\"mtd\" transform=\"translate(2756,0)\"><g data-mml-node=\"mo\"><use data-c=\"22EE\" xlink:href=\"#MJX-TEX-N-22EE\"></use></g></g></g></g></g></g></svg></mjx-container></p>\n<p>b<sub>101</sub> = 2<sup>100</sup>b<sub>1</sub> ..... (i)</p>\n<p>Also, a<